<Base title="Our shop, our roots" description="Get to know Nichols Auto Repair, part of the Wheat Ridge community since 1974. Personal service, clear conversations, and care for the cars you count on.">
 <section class="page-intro wrap"><span class="eyebrow">NICHOLS AUTO REPAIR · EST. 1974</span><h1>A neighborhood shop.<br/><em>A whole lot of heart.</em></h1><p>Cars bring you here. The people should make you feel welcome.</p></section>
 <section class="wrap split-section"><img class="rounded-photo" src="/images/workshop.jpg" alt="A technician with a vehicle in the Nichols workshop" width="1600" height="1200"/><div><span class="eyebrow">ROOTED IN WHEAT RIDGE</span><h2>Good work starts<br/><em>with a conversation.</em></h2><p>Nichols Auto Repair has served the Wheat Ridge area since 1974. From everyday maintenance to a classic car project, our shop is built around helping people take care of the vehicles that matter to them.</p><p>Tell us what you have noticed. Ask us what a repair means. We want you to understand your options and feel comfortable with your next step.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Meet us at the shop <Icon/></a></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHAT MATTERS HERE</span><h2>Simple principles.<br/><em>Every single day.</em></h2></div></div><div class="values-grid"><article><span>01 / LISTEN FIRST</span><h3>You know your car.</h3><p>That new sound, a change in the way it drives, or the story behind your classic. We start by listening.</p></article><article><span>02 / MAKE IT CLEAR</span><h3>Understand the work.</h3><p>We aim to explain what we find in plain language, so you can make an informed decision about repairs.</p></article><article><span>03 / THINK AHEAD</span><h3>More good miles.</h3><p>We can help you plan maintenance and talk through priorities for the way you use your vehicle.</p></article></div></section>
